{"nodes": [{"id": "assets_icrr_lockup_full_name_transparent", "label": "ICRR Horizontal Lockup (Full Name, Transparent)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "design-reference/assets/icrr_lockup_full_name_transparent.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Wide 2500x600 lockup: quadrant mark on the left, thin vertical hairline divider, then INTERNATIONAL COLLEGIATE RESEARCH REVIEW set on two letterspaced all-caps lines. Landscape ratio targets the site masthead / header bar and letterhead, where vertical space is scarce and horizontal space is not."}, {"id": "assets_icrr_lockup_full_name_transparent_wordmark", "label": "Letterspaced All-Caps Serif Wordmark", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "design-reference/assets/icrr_lockup_full_name_transparent.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'INTERNATIONAL COLLEGIATE RESEARCH REVIEW' set in a transitional/Didone serif, all caps, with wide tracking and broken across two lines of roughly equal measure. Wide tracking plus caps is the conventional scholarly-press signal; the two-line break keeps the wordmark from becoming an unusably long single ribbon."}, {"id": "assets_icrr_lockup_full_name_transparent_charcoal_ink", "label": "Charcoal Wordmark Ink (Off-Brand-Color Text)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "design-reference/assets/icrr_lockup_full_name_transparent.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The wordmark is set in near-black charcoal (approx #333A3D), deliberately NOT the oxblood used in the mark. Keeping oxblood exclusive to the mark stops the two elements competing, lets the mark stay the single accent, and makes the wordmark behave like ordinary body typography next to it."}, {"id": "assets_icrr_lockup_full_name_transparent_vertical_rule", "label": 